{"schema_version":1,"key":"p08-explicit-naming-request|control|1","case_id":"p08-explicit-naming-request","type":"naming","condition":"control","repetition":1,"status":"success","output":"- **待ち時間埋没（まちじかんまいぼつ）**  \n  AIの待ち時間を別作業で埋めた結果、余白そのものが消えてしまう状態。\n\n- **AI間詰め（エーアイまづめ）**  \n  AIの思考中という「間」に仕事を詰め込む行動を、短く印象的に表現。\n\n- **余白喰いマルチタスク**  \n  効率化のつもりの並行作業が、休息や思考の余白を食い尽くす現象。","usage":{"input_tokens":13272,"cached_input_tokens":12672,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":147,"reasoning_output_tokens":0},"workspace_changes":{"added":[],"modified":[],"removed":[]},"fixture_files":[],"started_at":"2026-09-05T04:39:59.966Z","finished_at":"2026-09-05T04:40:07.092Z","duration_ms":7126}
{"schema_version":1,"key":"p08-explicit-naming-request|skill|1","case_id":"p08-explicit-naming-request","type":"naming","condition":"skill","repetition":1,"status":"success","output":"1. **提案名：AI待ち時間埋没**\n\n   AIが考えている間に別の仕事を入れた結果、空き時間が消える状態。\n\n2. **提案名：AI思考中タスク差し込み**\n\n   AIが考えている最中に別の仕事を差し込み、空き時間がなくなる状態。\n\n3. **提案名：待ち時間セルフ消去**\n\n   AIの思考を待つ間に自分で別の仕事を入れ、空き時間を消してしまう状態。","usage":{"input_tokens":21948,"cached_input_tokens":10624,"cache_write_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":187,"reasoning_output_tokens":54},"workspace_changes":{"added":[],"modified":[],"removed":[]},"fixture_files":[],"started_at":"2026-09-05T04:40:01.827Z","finished_at":"2026-09-05T04:40:09.368Z","duration_ms":7541}
